.TH CPB 1 "1 November 2026" "CopyPasteBin 1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cpb \- local CopyPasteBin backend for GNOME
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cpb
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ command ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cpb
is the local command-line backend used by the CopyPasteBin GNOME Shell
extension and its editing windows. The normal user interface is the
CopyPasteBin indicator in GNOME Shell.
.PP
Analysis is performed on the local computer. The command does not contact a
network service. User configuration and metadata history are stored separately
for each account.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h , " " \-\-help
Display the available command-line options and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/copypastebin
Per-user configuration, custom rules and exclusions.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/copypastebin
Per-user metadata history and local state. Clipboard content is not stored in
the persistent history.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gnome-extensions (1)
